WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.262
Welcome to Module 14. We’ll use the Python skills from the course to build a first end-to-end machine learning workflow.

00:00:08.262 --> 00:00:11.937
The goal is not to master machine learning in one module.

00:00:11.937 --> 00:00:20.977
The goal is to understand the sequence: read data, define inputs and target, split the data, train a model, evaluate it,

00:00:20.977 --> 00:00:25.167
compare it with a baseline, and interpret the results carefully.

00:00:25.641 --> 00:00:32.526
Good modeling depends on good data preparation and honest evaluation, not just calling a model function.
